# Tail sampling "latency > p95" thresholds of the gateway (design §1.1), in ms.
# Source: `loadgen thresholds` on 2026-10-31: trace durations (root span) of the generated
# bench traffic, 100000 traces x 2 load generators, seed 7, 4 spans per trace; each trace
# replays real content-off golden fixture spans of its service's SDK, with their durations
# scaled by a deterministic +-20% jitter. Per service: p95 rounded up to the millisecond;
# the default for unknown services is the largest. For the record, p95 of the single
# content-off fixture spans per SDK (16 real captures): openinference 1989 ms, openllmetry 1979 ms, otel-genai 1915 ms.
# #21 replaces these values from representative traffic.
LATENCY_P95_MS_BENCH_OPENINFERENCE=4704
LATENCY_P95_MS_BENCH_OPENLLMETRY=4426
LATENCY_P95_MS_BENCH_OTEL_GENAI=4261
LATENCY_P95_MS_DEFAULT=4704
